      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/styles/replay-overlay.css",
      "content": "Grid items stretch vertically by default. When the readout is taller than the charts, this stretches `.replay-plot-frame` beyond the SVGs. Its `.replay-hits` layer uses `position: absolute; inset: 0`, so session buttons then extend into the empty space below the charts and hovering/clicking that space unexpectedly selects a session. Set `align-self: start` on the plot frame so its hit layer remains bounded by the actual charts.",
